SUMMARY:Art Loeb/North Slope Loop
DESCRIPTION:The Asheville Hiking Group\n**Art Loeb/North Slope Loop**\nDis
 tance: 7.5 miles\,\nElevation Gain: 1\,200'\nSpeed: 2-2.5mph average\n\nWe
 'll meet at the Pisgah Ranger station middle parking lot at 8:45 for a 9:0
 0 sharp departure.\n\nFrom the ranger station we'll walk along the exercis
 e trail over to the Art Loeb southern trailhead. Art Loeb to the North Slo
 pe Connecter to North Slope back to the Exercise Trail and the ranger stat
 ion.\n\nDogs are welcome. I'll have my dog with me.
